[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17103.99, "timestamp": "04:45:03", "text": "不，很多东西都在多个平台上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17107.47, "timestamp": "04:45:07", "text": "平台有很多你必须做的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17110.31, "timestamp": "04:45:10", "text": "随机考虑流媒体播放并不会造成问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17112.11, "timestamp": "04:45:12", "text": "意思是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17119.07, "timestamp": "04:45:19", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17122.15, "timestamp": "04:45:22", "text": "最终这需要时间。我想我上线了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17126.39, "timestamp": "04:45:26", "text": "这段旅程的慢速阶段是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17127.628, "timestamp": "04:45:27", "text": "创造者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17135.31, "timestamp": "04:45:35", "text": "时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17139.19, "timestamp": "04:45:39", "text": "所以，我必须做的就是真正开始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17143.43, "timestamp": "04:45:43", "text": "迟早都会做视频内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17145.628, "timestamp": "04:45:45", "text": "我得开始做视频了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17149.15, "timestamp": "04:45:49", "text": "内容会更快或更早发布。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17159.03, "timestamp": "04:45:59", "text": "但问题是，当我观看的时候"}]